#. Mutation, Cephalopod Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Become one with your surroundings."
msgstr "Станьте единым целым со своим окружением."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cephalopod Metamorphosis, Cephalopod
#. Mutation, Cephalopod Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You consumed cephalopod primer."
msgstr "Вы употребили праймер моллюска."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cephalopod Metamorphosis, Cephalopod
#. Mutation, Cephalopod Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your skin crawls and your extremities twitch and jerk."
msgstr "По коже бегут мурашки, а конечности беспорядочно дергаются."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_chimera"
