msgid "High School Graduate"
msgstr "Выпускник средней школы"

#. ~ Description of profession "High School Graduate" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've graduated from high school and thus know a little bit about applied "
"science and electronics."
msgstr ""
"Вы окончили среднюю школу и, следовательно, немного разбираетесь в "
"прикладных науках и электронике."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
