"no stranger to bicycles."
msgstr ""
"Будь то регулярные поездки на работу или просто езда ради удовольствия, вы "
"не незнакомы с велосипедами."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cyclist (Intermediate)"
msgstr "Велосипедист (средний уровень)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Intermediate)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've shed gallons of sweat, and more than a little blood, riding the "
"streets and trails as a cyclist."
msgstr ""
"Вы пролили галлоны пота и немало крови, катаясь по улицам и тропинкам в "
"качестве велосипедиста."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Cyclist (Intermediate)"
msgstr "Велосипедист (средний уровень)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Intermediate)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've shed gallons of sweat, and more than a little blood, riding the "
"streets and trails as a cyclist."
msgstr ""
"Вы пролили галлоны пота и немало крови, катаясь по улицам и тропинкам в "
"качестве велосипедиста."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cyclist (Expert)"
msgstr "Велосипедист (эксперт)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Expert)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've honed the fitness and form of a professional bicycle racer.  When "
"you're riding, your wheels are like an extension of your body."
msgstr ""
"Вы отточили физическую форму профессионального велогонщика. Когда вы едете, "
"ваши колеса как бы являются продолжением вашего тела."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Cyclist (Expert)"
msgstr "Велосипедист (эксперт)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Expert)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've honed the fitness and form of a professional bicycle racer.  When "
"you're riding, your wheels are like an extension of your body."
msgstr ""
"Вы отточили физическую форму профессионального велогонщика. Когда вы едете, "
"ваши колеса как бы являются продолжением вашего тела."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Basketball (Beginner)"
msgstr "Баскетбол (начинающий)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Beginner)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to shoot some b-ball outside of the school… at least, until a "
"couple of corpses who were up to no good started making trouble in your "
"neighborhood."
msgstr ""
"Ты раньше играл в баскетбол за пределами школы… по крайней мере, до тех пор,"
" пока пара трупов, которые не замышляли ничего хорошего, не начали создавать"
" проблемы в вашем районе."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Basketball (Beginner)"
msgstr "Баскетбол (начинающий)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Beginner)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to shoot some b-ball outside of the school… at least, until a "
"couple of corpses who were up to no good started making trouble in your "
"neighborhood."
msgstr ""
"Ты раньше играл в баскетбол за пределами школы… по крайней мере, до тех пор,"
" пока пара трупов, которые не замышляли ничего хорошего, не начали создавать"
" проблемы в вашем районе."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Basketball (Intermediate)"
msgstr "Баскетбол (средний уровень)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Intermediate)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Your ability to play point or post will beat the undead in overtime."
msgstr ""
"Вы хороши в защите и нападении с баскетбольным мечом, и нежити вас не "
"обыграть в овертайме."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Basketball (Intermediate)"
msgstr "Баскетбол (средний уровень)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Intermediate)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "Your ability to play point or post will beat the undead in overtime."
msgstr ""
"Вы хороши в защите и нападении с баскетбольным мечом, и нежити вас не "
"обыграть в овертайме."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Basketball (Expert)"
msgstr "Баскетбол (эксперт)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Expert)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You can sink 3-pointers all day, and dribble around the most determined "
"defenders."
msgstr ""
"Вы можете весь день забивать трехочковые и обводить самых решительных "
"защитников."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Basketball (Expert)"
msgstr "Баскетбол (эксперт)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Expert)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You can sink 3-pointers all day, and dribble around the most determined "
"defenders."
msgstr ""
"Вы можете весь день забивать трехочковые и обводить самых решительных "
"защитников."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Football (Beginner)"
msgstr "Футбол (начинающий)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Beginner)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd occasionally play touch or flag football at the park, but never got "
"too serious about it."
msgstr ""
"Время от времени вы играли в тач-футбол или флаг-футбол на территории парка,"
" но никогда не относились к этому слишком серьезно."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Football (Beginner)"
msgstr "Футбол (начинающий)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Beginner)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd occasionally play touch or flag football at the park, but never got "
"too serious about it."
msgstr ""
"Время от времени вы играли в тач-футбол или флаг-футбол на территории парка,"
" но никогда не относились к этому слишком серьезно."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Football (Intermediate)"
msgstr "Футбол (средний уровень)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Intermediate)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're no stranger to throwing the ol' pigskin and taking a few tackles.  "
"Hopefully your skills in dodging defenders will help you charge through the "
"hordes of undead."
msgstr ""
"Вам не привыкать бросать старую свиную шкуру и делать несколько подкатов. "
"Надеюсь, ваши навыки уклонения от защитников помогут вам прорваться сквозь "
"орды нежити."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Football (Intermediate)"
msgstr "Футбол (средний уровень)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Intermediate)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're no stranger to throwing the ol' pigskin and taking a few tackles.  "
"Hopefully your skills in dodging defenders will help you charge through the "
