msgstr ""
"Ты была подопытным кроликом, на котором лабораторные техники изучали "
"безмерную силу мутаций. Теперь ты полна решимости выжить вопреки всему, что "
"с тобой сделали."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Volunteer Mutant"
msgstr "Добровольный мутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Volunteer Mutant" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a mutant superhero through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for"
" a field test."
msgstr ""
"Ваши мечты стать супергероем-мутантом благодаря генетическим изменениям, "
"возможно, немного не сбылись, но ученые говорят, что вы готовы. Пришло время"
" для полевых испытаний."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Volunteer Mutant"
msgstr "Добровольный мутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Volunteer Mutant" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a mutant superhero through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for"
" a field test."
msgstr ""
"Ваши мечты стать супергероем-мутантом благодаря генетическим изменениям, "
"возможно, немного не сбылись, но ученые говорят, что вы готовы. Пришло время"
" для полевых испытаний."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Mutant Para-Amputee"
msgstr "Мутант-Пара-Ампутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Para-Amputee" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Many of the scientists investigating the immense power of mutation wondered "
"if it could cure limb loss and restore people.  You made the perfect subject"
" with which to test this.  Even though your day to experiment never came, "
"you might have some hope yet of seeing the potential cure to your problems."
msgstr ""
"Многие ученые, исследующие огромную силу мутации, задавались вопросом, может"
" ли она вылечить потерю конечностей и восстановить людей. Вы создали "
"идеальный объект для проверки этого. Даже если ваш день для экспериментов "
"так и не настал, у вас все же может быть некоторая надежда увидеть "
"потенциальное лекарство от ваших проблем."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mutant Para-Amputee"
msgstr "Мутант-Пара-Ампутант"

#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Para-Amputee" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Many of the scientists investigating the immense power of mutation wondered "
"if it could cure limb loss and restore people.  You made the perfect subject"
" with which to test this.  Even though your day to experiment never came, "
"you might have some hope yet of seeing the potential cure to your problems."
msgstr ""
"Многие ученые, исследующие огромную силу мутации, задавались вопросом, может"
" ли она вылечить потерю конечностей и восстановить людей. Вы создали "
"идеальный объект для проверки этого. Даже если ваш день для экспериментов "
"так и не настал, у вас все же может быть некоторая надежда увидеть "
"потенциальное лекарство от ваших проблем."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hitchhiker"
msgstr "Автостопщик"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitchhiker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Твой дом снесён, планета уничтожена, но не беда, главное, что у тебя всё ещё"
" есть твое полотенце."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hitchhiker"
msgstr "Автостопщица"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitchhiker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Твой дом снесён, планета уничтожена, но не беда, главное, что у тебя всё ещё"
" есть твое полотенце."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trapper"
msgstr "Зверолов"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trapper" for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life trapping with your father.  Both of you made a "
"decent living selling your catches and running trapping tutorials.  "
"Hopefully, your skills will come in useful against less conventional game."
msgstr ""
"Всю свою жизнь вы с отцом занимались звероловством. Вы неплохо жили за счёт "
"добычи диких зверей и выпуска пособий по их поимке. Помогут ли теперь эти "
"навыки против нынешней необычной дичи?"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Trapper"
msgstr "Зверолов"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trapper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life trapping with your father.  Both of you made a "
"decent living selling your catches and running trapping tutorials.  "
"Hopefully, your skills will come in useful against less conventional game."
msgstr ""
"Всю свою жизнь вы с отцом занимались звероловством. Вы неплохо жили за счёт "
"добычи диких зверей и выпуска пособий по их поимке. Помогут ли теперь эти "
"навыки против нынешней необычной дичи?"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Кузнец"

#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of"
" some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Проблемы начались, когда ты ты выходил с занятий по кузнечному мастерству в "
"твоём колледже, но несмотря на хаос, ты не растерял полезные инструменты, "
"которые были при тебе."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Кузнец"

#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of"
" some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Проблемы начались, когда ты ты выходила с занятий по кузнечному мастерству в"
" твоём колледже, но несмотря на хаос, ты не растеряла полезные инструменты, "
"которые были при тебе."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Jeweler"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Jeweler" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were an independent artisan, who made gorgeous rings and pendants for "
"the people who afforded your services.  You doubt the market for your work "
"has faired well after the end of the world, but perhaps your proficiency "
"with fine tools and metals will come in handy somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Jeweler"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Jeweler" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were an independent artisan, who made gorgeous rings and pendants for "
"the people who afforded your services.  You doubt the market for your work "
"has faired well after the end of the world, but perhaps your proficiency "
"with fine tools and metals will come in handy somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "Клоун"

#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Ты обожаешь смешить людей. Сбылась твоя голубая мечта — бросить школу и "
"выступать на детских праздниках, но случился конец света. Теперь на тебе "
"клоунский наряд, но, кроме зомби, нет зрителей."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "Клоун"

#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Ты обожаешь смешить людей. Сбылась твоя голубая мечта — бросить школу и "
"выступать на детских праздниках, но случился конец света. Теперь на тебе "
"клоунский наряд, но, кроме зомби, нет зрителей."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lost Submissive"
msgstr "Раб БДСМ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Submissive" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  "
"Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really "
"kinky black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"В чехарде конца света злая судьба разделила тебя со твоей госпожой. Теперь "
"ты предоставлен самому себе. На тебе остался чёрный кожаный костюм, "
"сексуально обтягивающий тело. К сожалению, у апокалипсиса нет стоп-слов."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lost Submissive"
msgstr "Рабыня БДСМ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Submissive" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  "
"Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really "
"kinky black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"В чехарде конца света злая судьба разделила тебя с твоим господином. Теперь "
"ты предоставлена самой себе. На тебе остался чёрный кожаный костюм, "
"сексуально обтягивающий тело. К сожалению, у апокалипсиса нет стоп-слов."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Senior Citizen"
msgstr "Пенсионер"

#. ~ Description of profession "Senior Citizen" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay "
"for what they've done."
msgstr ""
"Ты не видел столько крови со времён войны. Весь мир сошёл с ума! Они съели "
"твоих внуков! Чёрт побери, они расплатятся за это по полной."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Senior Citizen"
msgstr "Пенсионерка"

#. ~ Description of profession "Senior Citizen" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay "
"for what they've done."
msgstr ""
"Ты не видела столько крови со времён войны. Весь мир сошёл с ума! Они съели "
"твоих внуков! Чёрт побери, они расплатятся за это по полной."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Отаку"

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"После многих вечеров просмотра аниме с друзьями под лёгкий перекус ты решил "
"отправиться на грандиозный слёт анимешников. К сожалению, зомби съели твоих "
"друзей, и хуже того, слёт отменили. По крайней мере, ты можешь подлатать "
"свой костюм, если его порвут."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Отаку"

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
