"посылки вовремя… а вот зомби никто не упоминал."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Convict"
msgstr "Заключённый"

#. ~ Description of profession "Convict" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your trial was contentious, but ultimately you found yourself behind bars.  "
"The Cataclysm has offered you a chance to escape, but freedom may come with "
"a steep price."
msgstr ""
"Ваше дело в суде было спорным, но в итоге вы не избежали попадания за "
"решётку. Катаклизм дал вам шанс сбежать, но цена свободы непомерно высока."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Convict"
msgstr "Заключённая"

#. ~ Description of profession "Convict" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
