msgid "Assassin"
msgstr "Ассасин"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Old Veteran"
msgstr "Старый ветеран"

#. ~ Description of profession "Old Veteran" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been through hell once before.  Hopefully those weekend range trips "
"have kept your skills sharp."
msgstr ""
"Однажды ты уже прошел через ад. Надеюсь, эти поездки в выходные сохранили "
"твои навыки."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Old Veteran"
msgstr "Старый ветеран"

#. ~ Description of profession "Old Veteran" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been through hell once before.  Hopefully those weekend range trips "
"have kept your skills sharp."
msgstr ""
"Однажды ты уже прошел через ад. Надеюсь, эти поездки в выходные сохранили "
"твои навыки."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Urban Explorer"
msgstr "Городской исследователь"

#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Explorer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always admired the beauty of urban desolation, and were ready for "
"your next excursion when the end of the world hit.  You suppose that pretty "
"much every building could be considered abandoned now."
msgstr ""
"Вы всегда восхищались красотой городского запустения и уже были готовы к "
"следующей экскурсии, когда наступил конец света. Вы полагаете, что сейчас "
"практически каждое здание можно считать заброшенным."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Urban Explorer"
msgstr "Городской исследователь"

