msgstr "открытое усиленное пластиковое окно"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open reinforced plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A reinforced makeshift window comprised of three sheets of translucent, "
"rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame.  It'll do in a pinch.  It's open "
