"accuracy and power.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-reloaded "
"this one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  "
"Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"Патроны Винчестера калибра .308 с экспансивной пулей весом 168 гран. Патрон "
