"bullet, which comes at the cost of negligible expansion once the round "
"thunders into, and likely straight through, the target.  This one has been "
"hand-reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to "
"slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
