"Auto cartridge's power with lower recoil, the .40 S&W round became popular "
"for law enforcement and personal defense.  This one was a victim of a truly "
"desperate survivor, being loaded with powder from ground match heads.  Red "
"phosphorous is less energetic than even black powder, but its fast burn rate"
