"your ammunition, set aside whatever 7.62x51mm rounds you do NOT want to give"
" the turret) turning it on, and placing it on the ground, where it will "
"attach itself.  If programmed successfully, the turret will then identify "
"you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its M240."
msgstr ""
