#. ~ Description of "RM42 fighting knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"Widely regarded as Rivtech's most successful failure, this matte black knife"
" is made of top-quality steel with an incredibly sharp diamond edge.  Though"
" too expensive for the military or for most collectors, impossible to "
"sharpen once dulled, too large to conceal easily and rather impractical in a"
" world with guns but without trench warfare, it is nonetheless a very deadly"
" weapon and did find its way into the hands of some private contractors "
"before the end of all things.  It can be affixed to a gun as a bayonet."
msgstr ""

