#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use CBM weapons, but save 75% of total power for defense or utility CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Используй бионическое оружие, но приберегай 75% энергии для защитной или "
"вспомогательной бионики."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use CBM weapons, but save 50% of total power for defense or utility CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Используй бионическое оружие, но приберегай 50% энергии для защитной или "
"вспомогательной бионики."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use CBM weapons, but save 25% of total power for defense or utility CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Используй бионическое оружие, но приберегай 25% энергии для защитной или "
"вспомогательной бионики."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"Go wild with CBM weapons.  Don't reserve any power for defense or utility "
"CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Используй бионическое оружие сколько хочешь. Не приберегай энергию для "
"защитной или вспомогательной бионики."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "*will recharge power CBMs until <mypronoun> has 10% of total power."
msgstr "*1 будет перезаряжать КБМ до 10% от полного запаса."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "  When should <mypronoun> consume supplies to recharge power CBMs?"
msgstr "  Что <mypronoun> должен использовать для перезарядки КБМ?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We have plenty of supplies.  Recharge until you have 90% of total power."
msgstr "У нас полно припасов. Заряжайся до 90% максимального заряда."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "We have supplies.  Recharge until you have 75% of total power."
msgstr "У нас есть припасы. Заряжайся до 75% максимального заряда."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "We have some supplies.  Recharge until you have 50% of total power."
msgstr "У нас немного припасов. Заряжайся до 50% максимального заряда."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We're running low on supplies.  Recharge until you have 25% of total power."
msgstr "У нас кончаются припасы. Заряжайся до 25% максимального заряда."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We're almost out of supplies.  Recharge until you have 10% of total power."
msgstr "Припасы почти закончились. Заряжайся до 10% максимального заряда."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "*will not bother to aim at all."
msgstr "*не будет тратить время на прицеливание."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "  How should <mypronoun> aim?"
msgstr "  Как <mypronoun> должен целиться?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Aim when it's convenient."
msgstr "Целься, когда удобно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Go wild, you don't need to aim much."
msgstr "Не трать времени на прицеливание."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Take your time, aim carefully."
msgstr "Не торопись, целься тщательно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't shoot if you can't aim really well."
msgstr "Не стреляй, если не можешь хорошо прицелиться."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Why should I teach you?"
msgstr "Зачем мне обучать тебя?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Come on, we're friends."
msgstr "Ну давай, мы же друзья."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Forget it, let's get going."
msgstr "Забудь. Пошли."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Why should I host a training seminar?"
msgstr "Зачем мне проводить тренировочное занятие?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Follow same rules as this follower."
msgstr "Следуй тем же правилам, что и…"

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't pick up items."
msgstr "Не подбирать предметы."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You can pick up items now."
msgstr "Можно подбирать предметы."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't bash obstacles."
msgstr "Не ломать препятствия."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You can bash obstacles."
msgstr "Можно ломать препятствия."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay awake."
msgstr "Не ложиться спать."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Sleep when you feel tired."
msgstr "Можно ложиться спать, если устанешь."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay quiet."
msgstr "Тихо."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Tell me when you need something."
msgstr "Сообщи, когда тебе что-нибудь понадобится."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Leave corpses alone."
msgstr "Оставить трупы в покое."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Smash zombie corpses."
msgstr "Разбивать трупы зомби."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Leave doors open."
msgstr "Оставлять двери открытыми."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Close the doors."
msgstr "Закрывать двери."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Leave doors unlocked."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Lock any doors that you close."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Open doors to get where you're going."
msgstr "Открывай двери, если они мешают тебе пройти."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't walk through closed doors."
msgstr "Не трогай закрытые двери."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Unlock doors to get where you're going."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't unlock locked doors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "If you hear a noise but can't see the source, move to investigate it."
msgstr "Если услышишь шум неизвестно откуда, отправляйся искать источник."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't investigate noises that you can't see."
msgstr "Не ходи на шум, источник которого ты не видишь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Set up pickup rules."
msgstr "Установить правила сбора."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Clear all overrides."
msgstr "Очистить все блокировки."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You're really leaving?"
msgstr "Ты действительно уходишь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure.  Bye."
msgstr "Да, действительно. Пока."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Nah, I'm just kidding."
msgstr "Не, я просто шучу."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go to this location…"
msgstr "Пожалуйста, иди вот в это место…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay at your current position."
msgstr "Оставайся на том же месте."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm currently <current_activity>."
msgstr "Сейчас моё занятие — <current_activity>."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm not doing much currently."
msgstr "Я сейчас ничего не делаю."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I meant what are your goals?"
msgstr "Я имел в виду, какова твоя цель?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Carry on."
msgstr "Продолжай."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please stop your current activity."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, прекрати текущее занятие."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please sort out some of these items nearby."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, отсортируй ближайшие вещи."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do any construction work that you can."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, работай над любой строительной задачей, какую осилишь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do any mining work that you can."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, выполни любую работу по раскопкам, которую сможешь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go mop the area."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, уберись в этой области."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from a book."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, учись по книге."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from an e-book."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from books you have in order."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please start deconstructing any vehicles in a deconstruction zone."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, начни разбирать любые машины в области разборки."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please start repairing any vehicles in a repair zone."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, начни чинить все машины в области починки."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please chop logs into planks."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, руби брёвна на доски."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please butcher any corpses that you can."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, разделывай все трупы, какие сможешь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please chop any trees in the designated areas."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, руби все деревья в размеченных зонах."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go catch some fish."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, отправляйся на рыбалку."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do some farming work."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, займись работой в огороде."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please disassemble anything in the designated areas."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, разбери всё, что есть в размеченных зонах."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Can you craft this item?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "*pssshht* ten-four, I'll make my way there, over."
msgstr "*пшшш-пшшш* принято, выдвигаюсь, приём."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Sure thing, I'll make my way there."
msgstr "Хорошо, я выдвигаюсь туда."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "What about the camp?"
msgstr "Что насчет лагерей?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I want to assign you to work at this camp."
msgstr "Я хочу дать тебе работу в этом лагере."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go to this location."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, иди вот в это место."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"Since we can't build a camp here, I want you to tell me where can we build a"
" camp?"
msgstr ""
"Поскольку мы не можем построить здесь лагерь, скажите мне, где мы можем "
"построить лагерь?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Уверены?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Yes, I'm sure."
msgstr "Да, уверен."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Actually, never mind."
msgstr "Вообще-то забудь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Another survivor!  We should travel together."
msgstr "Ещё один выживший! Нам нужно двигаться вместе."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "Чем занимаешься?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Put away weapon."
msgstr "Убрать оружие."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Drop weapon."
msgstr "Бросить оружие."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'm not going to hurt you"
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я не причиню тебе вреда!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Drop your weapon!"
msgstr "Бросай оружие!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Get out of here or I'll kill you."
msgstr "Прочь с дороги, или я убью тебя."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Hey there, <name_g>."
msgstr "Привет, <name_g>."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Hello there."
msgstr "Привет."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Okay, no sudden movements…"
msgstr "Ладно, не делай резких движений…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Keep your distance!"
msgstr "Не подходи ближе!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "This is my territory, <name_b>."
msgstr "Это моя территория, <name_b>."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Calm down.  I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr "Успокойся. Я не причиню тебе зла."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Screw you, no."
msgstr "Иди на хрен, нет."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Put hands up."
msgstr "Поднять руки."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "*drops his weapon."
msgstr "*бросает своё оружие."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "*drops her weapon."
msgstr "*роняет её оружие."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Now get out of here"
msgstr "А теперь убирайся."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Now get out of here, before I kill you."
msgstr "Теперь убирайся отсюда, пока я тебя не убил."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Okay, I'm going."
msgstr "Ладно, я иду."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "About one of those jobs…"
msgstr "По поводу одного из этих заданий…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr "Что случилось?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr "Мне всё равно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I don't have any jobs for you."
msgstr "У меня нет работы для тебя."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I don't have any more jobs for you."
msgstr "У меня больше нет для тебя работы."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I have other jobs for you.  Want to hear about them?"
msgstr "У меня для тебя есть и другая работа. Хочешь послушать?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I have more jobs for you.  Want to hear about them?"
msgstr "У меня для тебя есть ещё работа. Хочешь послушать?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I have a job for you.  Want to hear about it?"
msgstr "У меня есть работа для тебя. Хочешь послушать?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I just have one job for you.  Want to hear about it?"
msgstr "У меня есть работа для тебя. Хочешь послушать?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Oh, okay."
msgstr "Ну, ладно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Never mind, I'm not interested."
msgstr "Неважно, мне не интересно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "You're not working on anything for me now."
msgstr "Ты сейчас на меня не работаешь."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Which job?"
msgstr "Какое задание?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "What about it?"
msgstr "Что насчёт него?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'll do it!"
msgstr "Я это сделаю!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Got any advice?"
msgstr "Что-нибудь посоветуешь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Can you share some equipment?"
msgstr "Можешь поделиться каким-нибудь снаряжением?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'll be back soon!"
msgstr "Я скоро вернусь!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "Sounds good, thanks."
msgstr "Хорошо, спасибо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sounds good.  Bye!"
msgstr "Хорошо. Пока!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "Прости."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Whatever.  Bye."
msgstr "Неважно. Пока."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry… I failed."
msgstr "Прости… У меня не вышло."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed him."
msgstr "Он мёртв."

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed it."
msgstr "Она мертва."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "No.  I'll get back to it, bye!"
msgstr "Нет. Я возвращаюсь за этим, пока!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Yup!  Here it is!"
msgstr "Ага! Вот оно!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "We're here!"
msgstr "Мы здесь!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Here I am."
msgstr "Вот и я."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I talked to them."
msgstr "Я поговорил."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Here it is!"
msgstr "Вот оно!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Justice has been served."
msgstr "Справедливость восторжествовала."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed them.  All of them."
msgstr "Они мертвы. Все."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I brought 'em."
msgstr "Мне удалось принёсти."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I've taken care of it"
msgstr "Мне удалось позаботиться об этом…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid ""
"I found it, but I'm keeping it, and I'll find you another one.  Let's talk "
"about something else."
msgstr ""
"У меня получилось найти, но пока попридержу, я найду тебе ещё. Давай "
"поговорим о чём-нибудь другом."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I found it, but I'm keeping it, and I'll find you another one.  Bye!"
msgstr "У меня получилось найти, но пока попридержу, я найду тебе ещё. Пока!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Mission success!  I don't know what else to say."
msgstr "Миссия выполнена! Тут и говорить нечего."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  I need no payment."
msgstr "Приятно было помочь. Оплаты не надо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "How about some items as payment?"
msgstr "Как насчёт каких-нибудь предметов в качестве оплаты?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
msgid "Maybe you can teach me something as payment?"
msgstr "Может, ты сможешь обучить меня чему-нибудь в качестве оплаты?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  I need no payment.  Bye!"
msgstr "Приятно было помочь. Мне не нужна оплата. Пока!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Glad to help."
msgstr "Приятно было помочь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  Bye!"
msgstr "Приятно было помочь. Пока!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Well, um, sorry."
msgstr "Ну… эмм… прости."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I did what I could."
msgstr "Прости, я сделал(а) всё, что получилось."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sure, here you go!"
msgstr "Конечно, бери!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Спасибо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Thanks, bye."
msgstr "Спасибо, пока."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Are we there yet, <name_g>?  I can't wait to burn that building!"
msgstr "Мы уже на месте, <name_g>? Не терпится сжечь то здание!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We're here.  Let's do it!"
msgstr "Мы на месте. Вперёд!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Be patient, <name_g>, we're getting there soon."
msgstr "Терпение, <name_g>, скоро будем на месте."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us."
msgstr "Что ж, похоже только ты да я."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "At least we've got shelter."
msgstr "По крайней мере у нас есть убежище."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "Что нам теперь делать?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Any tips?"
msgstr "Есть какие-нибудь советы?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "Хочешь пойти со мной?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to share some useful items with me?"
msgstr "Хочешь поделиться со мной полезными вещами?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I don't know, look for supplies and other survivors I guess."
msgstr "Я не знаю. Искать припасы и других выживших, полагаю."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "Возможно, нам стоит начать баррикадировать это место."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running would be really be useful if we have "
"to move."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We could look for a farm.  They should have food and tools, and they aren't "
"close to cities."
msgstr ""
"Мы могли бы поискать ферму. У них должна быть еда и инструменты, и они "
"находятся недалеко от городов."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We should probably stay away from cities, even if they have lots of "
"supplies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "Хмм, ладно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "Спасибо!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "Смотри на дорогу, бро!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm driving here!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr "У меня есть причины не рассказывать тебе об этом."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr "Ну, ладно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "И с чего мне идти с тобой?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "Понятно. Я достану антибиотики."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right, right, I'll ask later."
msgstr "Да, точно. Я спрошу позже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can keep you safe."
msgstr "Со мной ты будешь в безопасности."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You can keep me safe."
msgstr "С тобой я буду в безопасности."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll kill you if you don't."
msgstr "Я убью тебя если ты не сделаешь этого."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You got it, I'm with you!"
msgstr "Точно, я с тобой!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr "Шикарно!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "Ладно, пошли!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "Да? Я так не думаю."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "В чём дело?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "Далеко ещё?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "Я бы хотел стать лидером на какое-то время."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "В сторону. Теперь я лидер."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright.  You can lead now."
msgstr "Хорошо. Веди нас."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "Хорошо. Кое-что ещё…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "Да, пошли."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "Ладно, ладно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, show me how it's done."
msgstr "Ладно, покажи мне, как это делается."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's begin."
msgstr "Хорошо, приступим."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay.  Lead the way."
msgstr "Ладно. Веди меня."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "Нет, мы здесь будем в порядке."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "А впрочем, неважно."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, who should participate?"
msgstr "Ладно, кто будет участвовать?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Let's see…"
msgstr "Посмотрим…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's begin."
msgstr "Хорошо, приступим."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Хорошо."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while you're operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Я не могу полноценно обучать тебя, пока ты за рулём!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Я не могу тебя учить, когда я за рулём!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for denying you training."
msgstr "У меня есть причины не учить тебя."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We'll talk about a training seminar after you're done operating that "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Мы поговорим об тренировках после того, как ты перестанешь управлять "
"транспортом."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't host a seminar while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Я не могу учить, пока я за рулём!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason to refuse hosting a training seminar."
msgstr "У меня есть причины не проводить учебное занятие."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "Ни единого шанса, я сматываю удочки!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "Хорошо."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "Я на страже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "Тебе нужно пойти со мной."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "Увидимся."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I really don't feel comfortable doing so…"
msgstr "Мне действительно это неудобно…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give you some space."
msgstr "Я дам вам некоторое пространство."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd prefer to keep that to myself."
msgstr "Мне лучше держать это при себе."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I understand…"
msgstr "Я понимаю…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "С какой стати я буду делиться с тобой своим имуществом?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "Ладно, хорошо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm holding a thermal detonator!"
msgstr "Потому что у меня в руке термальный детонатор!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm your friend!"
msgstr "Потому что я твой друг!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I am helping you out…"
msgstr "Ну, я же тебе помогаю…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give it back!"
msgstr "Я всё верну обратно!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it to me, or else!"
msgstr "Отдавай по-хорошему!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Eh, never mind."
msgstr "Эх, неважно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Never mind, I'll do without.  Bye."
msgstr "Не бери в голову. И так справлюсь. Пока."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, here you go."
msgstr "Ладно, держи."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!  But can I have some more?"
msgstr "Спасибо! А могу ли я получить ещё?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks, see you later!"
msgstr "Спасибо, позже увидимся!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You picked up something that does not belong to you…"
msgstr "Ты берёшь кое-что чужое…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, this is all a misunderstanding.  Sorry, I'll drop it now."
msgstr "Ладно, ладно, у нас просто недопонимание. Извини, я это брошу."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, I'm keeping it.  Try and take it off me, I dare you."
msgstr "Нет, теперь это моё. Только попробуй отобрать."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Look, I really need this.  Please let me have it."
msgstr "Слушай, мне правда очень нужно. Пожалуйста, дай."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What, this?  It's not the same one, you are mistaken."
msgstr "Что, вот это? Ты ошибся, это другое."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  Look, I already dropped it, okay?"
msgstr "Мне жаль. Слушай, я уже бросаю, лады?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Don't try and talk yourself out of this, drop it now."
msgstr "Не пытайся заговорить мне зубы, бросай сейчас же."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, I'm dropping it…"
msgstr "Хорошо, я бросаю…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Just this once, you can keep it.  Don't tell anyone else."
msgstr "Забирай, но только на этот раз. Никому не говори."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_gode.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_mechanic.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_member.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/necropolis/npcs/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Спасибо."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right… I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "Верно… Мне не нужны неприятности."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Smart choice."
msgstr "Разумный выбор."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no>, and if you ask again, <ill_kill_you>!"
msgstr "<no>, и если будешь переспрашивать, <ill_kill_you>!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no><punc> <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "<no>, <punc>,  <fuck_you>!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, sorry."
msgstr "Ладно, ладно, извини."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Seriously, give me more stuff!"
msgstr "Я не шучу, дай мне что-нибудь!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine, bye."
msgstr "Ладно, хорошо, пока."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay <topic_item_price> per batch for a total of "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."
msgstr ""
"Я могу заплатить <topic_item_price> за штуку, всего "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "Сойдёт."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "Может позже."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "Приятно иметь с тобой дело!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You might be seeing more of me…"
msgstr "Думаю, мы ещё встретимся…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Excuse me?  Um… you mean you want to trade?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Ye!"
msgstr "Ага!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr "Серьёзно? Непохоже, чтоб тут было особенно безопасно, чтоб поболтать…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "It's fine, we've got a moment."
msgstr "Всё хорошо, у нас есть минутка."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Good point, let's find a more appropriate place."
msgstr "Точно, давай найдём место получше."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "You're right.  Forget I said anything, let's get moving."
msgstr "Ты прав. Забудь мои слова, давай идти дальше."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "What did you want to talk about?"
msgstr "О чём ты хотел поговорить?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "<chitchat_player_responses>"
msgstr "<chitchat_player_responses>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_TRAIN_DATA.json
msgid "The computer awaits input…"
msgstr "Компьютер ожидает ввод…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Emergency Message."
msgstr "Экстренное сообщение."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/necropolis/npcs/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Disable External Power"
msgstr "Отключить внешний источник энергии"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "Свяжитесь с нами"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Log off."
msgstr "Выйти из системы."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"GREETINGS CITIZEN.  A BIOLOGICAL ATTACK HAS TAKEN PLACE AND A STATE OF EMERGENCY HAS BEEN DECLARED.  EMERGENCY PERSONNEL WILL BE AIDING YOU SHORTLY.  TO ENSURE YOUR SAFETY PLEASE FOLLOW THE STEPS BELOW.\n"
" 1. DO NOT PANIC.\n"
" 2. REMAIN INSIDE THE BUILDING.\n"
" 3. SEEK SHELTER IN THE BASEMENT.\n"
" 4. USE PROVIDED GAS MASKS.\n"
" 5. AWAIT FURTHER INSTRUCTIONS."
msgstr ""
"ПРИВЕТСТВУЕМ, ГРАЖДАНИН. ПРОИЗОШЛО БИОЛОГИЧЕСКОЕ НАПАДЕНИЕ И ОБЪЯВЛЕНО ЧРЕЗВЫЧАЙНОЕ ПОЛОЖЕНИЕ. ЭКСТРЕННЫЙ ПЕРСОНАЛ ВСКОРЕ ПРИБУДЕТ НА ПОМОЩЬ. ДЛЯ ОБЕСПЕЧЕНИЯ ВАШЕЙ БЕЗОПАСНОСТИ СЛЕДУЙТЕ СЛЕДУЮЩИМ ПУНКТАМ.\n"
" 1. НЕ ПАНИКУЙТЕ.\n"
" 2. ОСТАВАЙТЕСЬ ВНУТРИ ЗДАНИЯ.\n"
" 3. УКРОЙТЕСЬ В ПОДВАЛЕ.\n"
" 4. ИСПОЛЬЗУЙТЕ ПРЕДОСТАВЛЯЕМЫЕ ПРОТИВОГАЗЫ.\n"
" 5. ОЖИДАЙТЕ ДАЛЬНЕЙШИХ ИНСТРУКЦИЙ. "

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Press any key."
msgstr "Нажмите любую клавишу"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"--ACCESS GRANTED--\n"
"Mission Complete!"
msgstr ""
"--ДОСТУП ПОЛУЧЕН--\n"
"Миссия выполнена!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid ""
"REFUGEE CENTER FOUND!  IF YOU HAVE ANY FEEDBACK CONCERNING YOUR VISIT PLEASE CONTACT\n"
" THE DEPARTMENT OF EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT PUBLIC AFFAIRS OFFICE.\n"
" THE LOCAL OFFICE CAN BE REACHED BETWEEN THE HOURS OF 9AM AND\n"
" 4PM AT 555-0164.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU WOULD LIKE TO SPEAK WITH SOMEONE IN PERSON OR WOULD LIKE\n"
"TO WRITE US A LETTER PLEASE SEND IT TO…"
msgstr ""
"НАЙДЕН ЦЕНТР БЕЖЕНЦЕВ! ЕСЛИ У ВАС ЕСТЬ ОТЗЫВ ПО ВАШЕМУ ВИЗИТУ, ПОЖАЛУЙСТА, СВЯЖИТЕСЬ\n"
"С ОФИСОМ ОБЩЕСТВЕННЫХ ДЕЛ ДЕПАРТАМЕНТА ПО ЧРЕЗВЫЧАЙНЫМ СИТУАЦИЯМ.\n"
"С МЕСТНЫМ ОФИСОМ МОЖНО СВЯЗАТЬСЯ С 9:00 И\n"
"ДО 16:00 ПО ТЕЛЕФОНУ 555-0164.\n"
"\n"
"ЕСЛИ ВЫ ХОТИТЕ ПОГОВОРИТЬ С КЕМ-ТО ЛИЧНО ИЛИ\n"
"НАПИСАТЬ НАМ ПИСЬМО, ПОЖАЛУЙСТА ОТПРАВЬТЕ ЕГО…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_COMPUTER.json
msgid "Make a note of the location."
msgstr "Сделать заметку об этом месте."

