#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
msgstr "Добыть 25 литров ацетилена"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Bring me 25 liters of acetylene."
msgstr "Принеси мне 25 литров ацетилена."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid ""
"With all the repairs we've been doing around here, my team is running low on"
" welding gas.  Without it, I can't fix any busted bikes or make any new "
"ones, so I need you to get me twenty-five liters of acetylene.  I'll pay you"
" well for it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Those bikes are vital to our operations, we'll collapse without them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "I'd check a garage in town."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Do you have the gas?"
msgstr "Газ у тебя с собой?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid ""
"This ought'a keep us afloat for a bit.  If you need any mechanical work "
"done, come by and see me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 25 liters of acetylene"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "I don't see the <swear> gas, <name_b>."
msgstr "Где <swear> газ, <name_b>?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 steel welding rods"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 steel welding rods"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Bring me 100 steel welding rods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 steel welding rods"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid ""
"The acetylene pulled us through, but now we're out of welding rods.  If you "
"could get about 100, I'll buy 'em."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 steel welding rods"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "I can't work without them, ya know."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 steel welding rods"
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
