msgstr "Книга с надписью «Не паникуй» на обложке."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid ""
"A book: Feng Shui, Zen: the art of randomly arranging items that are not "
"kitten."
msgstr ""
"Книга: Фен-шуй, дзен: искусство случайного сбора вещей, не являющихся "
"котёнком."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A broken metronome sits here, it's needle off to one side."
msgstr ""
"Здесь лежит сломанный метроном, его игла застряла, наклонившись в одну из "
"сторон."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
