msgstr "Балончик со взбитыми сливками под давлением без взбитых сливок."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A card shark sits here, practicing his Faro shuffle.  He ignores you."
msgstr ""
"Здесь сидит карточная акула и практикует тасование фаро. Он игнорирует вас."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A chain hanging from two posts reminds you of the Gateway Arch."
msgstr "Цепь, свисающая с двух столбов, напоминает Ворота Запада."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A compendium of haiku about metals."
msgstr "Сборник хайку о металлах."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A copy of DeCSS.  They're a dime a dozen these days."
msgstr "Копия DeCSS. Сейчас такие ничего не стоят."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A coupon for one free steak-fish at your local family diner."
msgstr "Купон на один бесплатный рыбный стейк в местной семейной закусочной."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A crowd of people, and at the center, a popular misconception."
msgstr "Толпа людей, а в центре - распространенное заблуждение."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A demonic voice proclaims \"There is no kitten, only Zuul\".  You flee."
msgstr ""
"Демонический голос провозглашает «Котёнка нет, только Зуул». Вы сбегаете "
