msgstr "Пакет из-под молока с чёрно-белым изображением котенка сбоку."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A neural net -- maybe it's trying to recognize kitten."
msgstr "Нейросеть - возможно, она пытается распознать котенка."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL
#. licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
