"break-down, internal hemorrhaging, muddling ley lines, and overcharging "
"electronics.  Immensely gruesome and crude, it was once illegal world-wide, "
"not that it matters now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
