#. ~ 3 Technomancer spells
#. ~ Description of "Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This lab reference material book is thick and overflowing with information "
"on combining magic with EM radiation."
msgstr ""
"Этот толстый лабораторный справочник полон информации о сочетании магии с "
"электромагнитным излучением."

#. ~ 2 animist and 1 classless spells
