msgid ""
"You have a hard time sensing the mana in your body, making less of your "
"reserves available for use."
msgstr "Вы плохо чувствуете ману в своём теле, что снижает доступные запасы."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Very Poor Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Очень плохая чувствительность к мане"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Abysmal Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Ужасная чувствительность к мане"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Slime Breath"
msgstr "Слизистое дыхание"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your breath is sticky and slimy somehow.  This won't damage your "
"interactions with people but it's definitely noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Ваше дыхание почему-то липкое и слизистое. Это не повредит вашему "
"взаимодействию с людьми, но определенно заметно."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Chimeric Breath"
msgstr "Дыхание химеры"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chimeric Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your breath could metaphorically melt lead.  It's horrible.  It's so bad "
"that it can actually distract from your attempts to intimidate someone."
msgstr ""
"Образно говоря, ваше дыхание может расплавить свинец. Это ужасно. Это "
"настолько плохо, что может отвлечь от ваших попыток кого-то запугать."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgstr "Отладочная заклинательная мутация"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Spell Mutation"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Gives all of the debug spells at max level."
msgstr "Даёт все отладочные заклинания на максимальном уровне."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Wildshape: Fish"
msgstr "Дикая форма: рыба"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Fish"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are fish-like.  Just keep swimming!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Wildshape: Bear"
msgstr "Дикая форма: медведь"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Bear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"You are bear-like, granting you raw bestial power in exchange for "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Wildshape: Deer"
msgstr "Дикая форма: олень"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Deer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid ""
"You are deer-like, giving you the ability to move quickly and escape danger."
"  It is hard to use your arms in combat, however."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Mirror Displacement"
msgstr "Зеркальное смещение"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mirror Displacement"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Future Sight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/mutation.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You aren't where you seem to be."
msgstr "Вы не там, где кажется."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Horns"
msgstr "Демонические рога"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Horns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid ""
"Large ram horns curl around your ears on each side of your head.  Gives you "
"a headbutt attack and head protection."
msgstr ""
"Большие бараньи рога вьются вокруг ушей с обоих сторон вашей головы. Дает "
"вам возможность нанести удар головой и защиту головы."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Demon Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
#, c-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your horns"
msgstr "Вы бодаете противника (%s) своими рогами"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Demon Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their horns"
msgstr "%1$s бодает противника (%2$s) своими рогами!"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Hooves"
msgstr "Демонические копыта"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Hooves"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your toes have merged into cloven hooves, like that of a goat.  You also "
"have coarse brown fur from the waist down."
msgstr ""
"Ваши пальцы ног слились в раздвоенные копыта, как у козла. Еще у вас "
"появился грубый коричневый мех ниже талии."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demonic Possession"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid ""
"You are possessed by a greater demon, giving you great strength and combat "
"abilities but reducing your fine motor control skills.  This gives you a "
"slower crafting speed and the inability to cast spells."
msgstr ""
"Вы одержимы более сильным демоном, что дает вам большую силу и боевые "
"способности, но снижает ваши навыки мелкой моторики. Из-за этого вы "
"медленнее изготовляете и не можете читать заклинания."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Claws"
msgstr "Демонические когти"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Demon Skin"
msgstr "Демоническая кожа"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Skin"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Your skin is crimson."
msgstr "Ваша кожа багровая."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "Goat Tail"
msgstr "Козлиный хвост"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Goat Tail"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/temporary_demon_traits.json
msgid "You have a short, stubby goat tail."
msgstr "У вас короткий козий хвост."

