#. ~ Label of UI widget "xe_max_mana_num"
#. ~ Label of UI widget "xe_spacebar_max_mana_num"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/ui/sidebar.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ui/sidebar.json
msgid "Max Mana"
