"This notebook is mostly a series of fanciful speculations about something "
"the author alternately calls \"Matrix Mechanics,\", \"Dimensional "
"Metaphysics,\" or \"Netherium Mathematics,\" sometimes using more than one "
"in the same sentence.  Most of it is incoherent, but there is some "
"experimental data about \"Conscious redirection of nether energy\" that "
"catches your eye."
msgstr ""

