#. ~ Description of "Report: Drain Channeling Protocol PGS38"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report on a process to reduce the fatiguing effects of long-term "
"psionic use.  It describes a special meditation technique, performed with "
"the aid of a matrix crystal, though it does warn that the process: \"puts "
"extreme stress on the focus object.  Further refinement is required.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
