#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A feral security guard with a military-style uniform, bearing the XEDRA logo"
" and some kind of rank insignia.  Their movements are precise, controlled, "
"and inhumanly smooth, and while their eyes are still bloodshot, they have a "
"spark lacking in most ferals you've seen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
