"&A quick check reveals nothing out of the ordinary.  To <npc_name>, you're "
"just another face in the crowd."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
