#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
msgid ""
"Utilizing the unstable, reality-changing nature of the warp shards, you "
"could combine several to create a powerful semi-magical item.  This is a "
"skill you have no way of practicing and a field of science no one's ever "
"really touched, so exactly what you'd get from it is anyone's guess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_spawn_random_artifact_fromrecipe"
