#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "Find Antivirals Before You Die!"
msgstr "Найдите противовирусные, пока вы не умерли!"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "You take an antiviral."
msgstr "Вы приняли противовирусное."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid ""
"You seem to be feeling a little better, but the prickling sensation remains."
msgstr ""
"Кажется, вы чувствуете себя немного лучше, но ощущение покалывания остаётся."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid ""
"You no longer feel uncomfortably itchy, but your skin is still concerningly "
"pale."
msgstr ""
"Вы больше не чувствуете неприятного зуда, но ваша кожа всё ещё относительно "
"бледная."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid ""
"Some of the lesions on your skin have begun to heal, but the itchiness "
"remains."
msgstr "Некоторые повреждения кожи начали заживать, но зуд всё ещё остаётся."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid "Itchy pale skin"
msgstr "Зуд и бледная кожа"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid "Necrotic skin"
msgstr "Омертвелая кожа"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid "Pallor"
msgstr "Бледность"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin, Pallor"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and covered in gross sores.  It's like your skin is "
"rotting right off your body."
msgstr ""
"Ваша кожа бледная и покрыта грубыми язвами. Как будто кожа сгнила прямо на "
"теле."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin, Pallor"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid "Your skin is pale and there are dark spots around your eyes."
msgstr "Ваша кожа бледная, вокруг глаз тёмные круги."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin, Pallor"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and there are dark spots around your eyes.  You feel a "
"constant itching sensation, like your skin could fall off at any moment."
msgstr ""
"Ваша кожа бледная, вокруг глаз тёмные круги. Вы чувствуете постоянный зуд, "
"как будто ваша кожа может отвалиться в любой момент."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin, Pallor"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid "An ominous prickling feeling reverberates through your body."
msgstr "Зловещее покалывание разносится по телу."

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin,
#. Pallor"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
